{"id": "68961", "title": "摘星", "author": "林笛儿", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 22, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68961.htm", "intro": "他是军中年轻的少将，沉稳、渊博、形像高大 \r\n她是初出校门的社会小菜鸟，冲动、仗义、乐天派 \r\n一场意外 \r\n他身败名裂、形像俱毁，成为千夫所指的负心汉 \r\n她是那传说中的小三 \r\n亡羊补牢 \r\n两人无奈牵手进婚姻圣殿 \r\n他说：委屈你了 \r\n她回道：哪里，哪里，既见君子，云胡不喜？ \r\n其实谈不上委屈，谁让她是肇事者呢？\r\n（小文艺，大狗血，恶趣味，非喜勿入！） \r\n\r\n \r\n主角关键字 —— 卓逸帆", "base": "files/article/html/68/68961", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10552250.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10552251.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10552252.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10552253.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10552254.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10552255.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10552256.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10552257.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10552258.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "10552259.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "10552260.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-60", "file": "10552261.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-65", "file": "10552262.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-70", "file": "10552263.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-75", "file": "10552264.html", "available": false}, {"title": "76-80", "file": "10552265.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-85", "file": "10552266.html", "available": false}, {"title": "86-90", "file": "10552267.html", "available": false}, {"title": "91-95", "file": "10552268.html", "available": false}, {"title": "96-100", "file": "10552269.html", "available": false}, {"title": "101-105", "file": "10552270.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10552271.html", "available": false}]}